# This repository is code only.
#
# The Nova SM3 binary assets - printable STLs, wiring diagrams, MP3s, the
# photos and the parts list - are large (~212MB) and unchanged from
# upstream, so they are deliberately not tracked here. They still live in
# your working directory; get them from the upstream project if you need
# them on another machine:
#
#   https://github.com/cguweb-com/Arduino-Projects/tree/main/Nova-SM3
#
Nova-SM3/STL Files/
Nova-SM3/Wiring/
Nova-SM3/MP3/
Nova-SM3/Remote Control/
Nova-SM3/*.jpg
Nova-SM3/*.png
Nova-SM3/*.psd
Nova-SM3/*.xlsx
Nova-SM3/*.html
Nova-SM3/README.md

